# Dentro Project Rules

## Product Identity

This project is Dentro.

Dentro is an AI-powered vehicle condition scanning platform for:

- car rental companies
- car-sharing companies
- used-car dealers
- fleet operators

The purpose:
Users upload vehicle photos during pickup/return.
AI detects:

- scratches
- dents
- panel damage
- misalignment

The system generates:

- objective damage reports
- confidence scores
- timestamped inspection records
- before/after comparisons

Do NOT treat this as a generic web application.

---

# Brand Personality

Dentro should feel like:

- automotive technology
- enterprise inspection software
- AI computer vision platform
- modern fleet management system

Design inspiration:

- Tesla service technology
- NVIDIA AI enterprise products
- Palantir data platforms
- automotive diagnostic tools

Avoid:

- generic startup landing pages
- cryptocurrency style UI
- excessive gradients
- childish illustrations
- generic SaaS templates
- random card grids

---

# Visual Design Direction

Preferred:

Theme:

- dark professional interface
- automotive/engineering aesthetic
- high contrast
- clean typography

UI elements:

- vehicle inspection panels
- image comparison views
- detection overlays
- confidence indicators
- damage reports
- analytics dashboards
- timeline views

Use:

- subtle animations
- technical visualizations
- realistic automotive terminology

---

# Frontend Stack

Frontend:

- React
- JavaScript
- Node.js ecosystem

Follow existing project structure.

Do not introduce new frameworks without approval.

---

# AI Features To Represent

The UI should communicate:

Computer Vision Pipeline:

Vehicle Image
↓
Image Processing
↓
YOLOv8 Detection
↓
Damage Classification
↓
Condition Report

Detected defects:

- scratches
- dents
- panel misalignment

---

# User Personas

Design for:

## Rental Companies

Needs:

- fast vehicle handover
- reduce disputes
- fleet overview

## Used Car Dealers

Needs:

- inspection reports
- vehicle valuation
- customer trust

## Customers

Needs:

- simple photo upload
- transparent damage records

---

# Component Guidelines

Prefer components like:

- VehicleScanner
- DamageDetectionViewer
- InspectionReport
- VehicleComparison
- ConfidenceScore
- DefectTimeline
- UploadWorkflow

Avoid meaningless components like:

- FeatureCard
- ModernCard
- GradientSection

unless they have a clear purpose.

---

# Before Changing UI

Before modifying files:

1. Analyze existing design.
2. Explain current problems.
3. Propose a new design direction.
4. List files to modify.

---

# Coding Rules

- Keep existing functionality.
- Make small incremental changes.
- Do not remove working AI/API integration.
- Reuse existing components.
- Maintain clean React code.
